# Tocatli Honor Guard's "Creatures entering don't cause abilities to trigger" applies to its own entering (the rulings:
# "This includes abilities that would trigger when Tocatli Honor Guard itself enters"; CR 603.6a: the newcomers are on
# the battlefield when the event is checked). Enduring Innocence draws "whenever one or more other creatures you control
# with power 2 or less enter", once each turn (CR 603.2h). On turn 1 Ornithopter enters and it draws (the control). On
# turn 3 the Honor Guard, power 1, enters and it does not draw; a trigger that never happened does not use up the turn, so
# once Bot1 has Bolted its own Honor Guard, the second Ornithopter draws.
# Hand: 7 - Plains, Mox Pearl, Mox Ruby, Black Lotus, Innocence, Ornithopter = 1, + 1 drawn = 2; turn 3 draws (3), casts
# the Honor Guard (2) and the Bolt (1), and the Ornithopter (0), + 1 drawn = 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Enduring Innocence
Ornithopter
Tocatli Honor Guard
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

